t skills to navigate dangerous environments, escape terrifying threats, and stay alert as you venture deeper into the horror. Every encounter brings a new challenge, and survival is never guaranteed.\n\nCan you survive Huss Apes?\n\nThe hunt begins soon.", "short_description": "Prepare to enter a world of fear.\n\nHuss Apes is an intense VR horror experience featuring fast-paced, Gorilla Tag-inspired movement, terrifying encounters, and unpredictable chases. Inspired by games like Lethal Ape and Scary Baboon, Huss Apes challenges players to explore, survive, and face the unknown.\n\nUse your movement skills to navigate dangerous environments, escape terrifying threats, and stay alert as you venture deeper into the horror. Every encounter brings a new challenge, and surviva"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://huss-apes.lovable.app/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Vexale Inc. Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://huss-apes.lovable.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": [], "id": "1402124146313833"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_1672132017646803_4054040074224613691_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_si